+<div class="hero-copy"><div data-experiment="hero"><div class="eyebrow"><svg><use href="#compass"/></svg>Less ordinary. More you.</div><h1>Go a little<br>further.<br>Find <em>elsewhere.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Away from the crowds. Closer to what matters.<br>Thoughtfully crafted trips for the curious at heart.</p><button class="primary" data-plan>Find my adventure <span class="arrow">↗</span></button><p class="cta-note">A world of possibility. A trip that feels like you.</p><div class="social-proof"><div class="avatars"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=faces" alt="" width="32" height="32"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=faces" alt="" width="32" height="32"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524504388940-b1c1722653e1?w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=faces" alt="" width="32" height="32"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=faces" alt="" width="32" height="32"></div><div><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><div class="proof-caption">For people who take the scenic route.</div></div></div></div><div class="experiment-loading" role="status">Finding your elsewhere…</div></div>
