+<section class="features" id="why-elsewhere" aria-label="Why travel with elsewhere"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon"><svg><use href="#compass"/></svg></div><div><h3>Follow your curiosity</h3><p>Hidden corners, local favorites, and the places you won't find on every list.</p></div></div><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon"><svg><use href="#leaf"/></svg></div><div><h3>Good for you. Better for the planet.</h3><p>Thoughtful stays and local connections that give a little more than they take.</p></div></div><div class="feature"><div class="feature-icon"><svg><use href="#sun"/></svg></div><div><h3>All the wonder. None of the work.</h3><p>Considered details, a little breathing room, and a trip made entirely yours.</p></div></div></section>
